title: A file typed in and not saved is staged: it is saved first, then staged whole (git diff empty for it, index holds the typed line), and quitting asks nothing
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/src/util.rs :: ^pub fn double\(n: u32\) -> u32 \{\n// typed before staging\n    n \* 2\n
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: script: Answer

wait 3000
left changes
edit src/util.rs 2 1
type // typed before staging
key enter
wait 800
mark typed
wait 500
git stage src/util.rs
wait 1500
mark staged
wait 500
quit
wait 1000
answer Close without saving
wait 800
